# Product Updates

This guide explains how buyers access product updates after purchasing a product on the Codexeron Marketplace.

Keeping products updated helps buyers benefit from improvements, bug fixes, security enhancements, and new features.

---

# Update Overview

When a seller releases a new version of a purchased product, eligible buyers may receive access to the update according to the product license terms.

Updates may include:

- Bug fixes
- Security improvements
- Performance improvements
- New features
- Compatibility updates
- Documentation improvements

---

# Accessing Updates

Buyers can access available updates through their Codexeron account.

Update information may include:

- Product version
- Release date
- Changelog
- Updated files
- Compatibility information

---

# Version Information

Products use version numbers to identify releases.

Recommended format:

```
v1.0.0
v1.0.1
v1.1.0
v2.0.0
```

Version history helps buyers understand product changes.

---

# Update Notifications

When available, Codexeron may provide notifications about:

- New product versions
- Important security updates
- Product changes
- Documentation updates

Notification features may expand in future releases.

---

# Update Access

Update availability depends on:

- Product license terms
- Seller update policy
- Purchase conditions
- Marketplace rules

Some products may include lifetime updates, while others may have limited update periods.

---

# Before Installing Updates

Before updating a product:

- Review the changelog.
- Check compatibility requirements.
- Backup existing installations.
- Follow the seller's update instructions.

---

# Previous Versions

Previous product versions may remain available depending on:

- Seller policies
- License conditions
- Technical requirements

Buyers should use supported versions whenever possible.

---

# Security Updates

Security-related updates are important for protecting systems.

Buyers are encouraged to:

- Install important security updates.
- Review update notes.
- Keep installed products maintained.

---

# Support

If an update causes issues:

- Review the documentation.
- Check compatibility information.
- Contact the seller when support is available.
- Contact Codexeron support for platform-related issues.

